        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In particular, as part of such process, in 2023 we downsized our Chinese manufacturing plant located in Shanghai, leading to a further reduction in the number of workers.",
