        "statement": "We have one 22,000 square meter manufacturing facility located in Quanjiao - County - Anhui province, China, Natuzzi Quanjiao Limited, which is wholly indirectly controlled by the Company through Natuzzi China, became operational in 2022 and was expanded in 2024 as a result of the closure of the Shanghai facility.",
