        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are also continually improving our customers’ journey from the time they visit our website to the delivery of their purchased products or their visit to our points of sale by boosting our engagement tools.",
