        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "In order to enhance efficiency and flexibility, as well as better serve wholesale mass distributors (“Mass Merchants”), in December 2019, we started an outsourcing program in Vietnam intended to supply an increasing portion of Mass Merchants in North America.",
